arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:3:description: Adversarial review of prose drafts by N reviewers, then revise. Not for code.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:8:A multi-reviewer pipeline for rigorous prose revision. Three independent
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:9:reviewers (pessimist, optimist, structuralist) critique a draft in parallel,
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:11:revision editor produces the updated draft. A human gate lets you review
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:17:through `megaplan run writing-panel-strict ...` or
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:23:graph-born plan directories keep resuming on graph. Native-born runs resume on
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:37:- `draft` (file, required): Path to the markdown draft to review.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:43:megaplan run writing-panel-strict path/to/draft.md
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:46:megaplan run writing-panel-strict path/to/draft.md --mode polish
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:49:megaplan run writing-panel-strict path/to/draft.md --profile @writing-panel-strict:standard
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:51:# Resume after human gate
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:52:megaplan resume <plan-dir> --choice continue
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:53:megaplan resume <plan-dir> --choice stop
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:58:1. **Panel Review** (parallel) — pessimist, optimist, and structuralist review the draft independently.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/writing_panel_strict/SKILL.md:59:2. **Synthesis** — editor reconciles the three reviews into a revision brief.
