arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:341:   - `megaplan cloud deploy --cloud-yaml cloud.<chain>.yaml` only when adding new repos or bumping `megaplan.ref` (the entrypoint is baked in at build time).
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:342:   - `megaplan cloud preflight --cloud-yaml .megaplan/initiatives/<chain>/cloud.yaml .megaplan/initiatives/<chain>/chain.yaml`
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:343:   - `megaplan cloud chain --cloud-yaml .megaplan/initiatives/<chain>/cloud.yaml .megaplan/initiatives/<chain>/chain.yaml --fresh` to validate, upload, launch, and watchdog-verify.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:346:   - `megaplan cloud status --all --cloud-yaml cloud.<chain>.yaml` first.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:347:   - `megaplan cloud status --all --compact --since 12h --cloud-yaml cloud.<chain>.yaml` for a compact recent-activity handoff.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/cloud_skill.md:348:   - `megaplan cloud status --chain` for one chain's detailed summary.
