arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:5:Scope: signal ideas for the megaplan 6-hour progress auditor, including low-level execution signals, cloud/runtime signals, human/PR/CI gates, repair/meta-repair custody, and high-level process inefficiencies.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:7:Source: 9 DeepSeek subagents, one per plane:
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:10:- chain/plan state truth
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:16:- human/PR/CI gates
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:32:The main improvement is not just more issue detectors. It is better evidence coverage and better shape. The report should tell the model what planes were inspected, what evidence was missing, what contradictions exist, and which signals are negative controls. That nudges the model toward breadth without making the gather phase agentic.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:36:- chain says done but plan/session/PR says not done
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:41:- human/PR/CI gate is blocking but the system keeps treating it as execution work
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:56:    "plan_id": "..."
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:59:    "plan_state": "present|missing|stale|contradictory",
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:60:    "plan_vs_discovered_sessions": "checked|missing",
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:93:  "plane": "repair_custody",
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:94:  "entity": "session|plan|chain|host|pr",
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:121:- `chain_inconsistent_done`: chain claims complete, but plan/session/PR/user-action evidence disagrees.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:123:- `completed_count_index_disagreement`: completed count and current plan index disagree.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:124:- `state_mismatch`: chain state, plan state, latest session state, and watchdog report disagree.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:137:- `watchdog_no_current_target_evidence`: watchdog claims a current target but cannot point to current session/plan artifacts.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:178:Reason: many apparent planning failures are actually environment drift.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:187:- `phase_duration_exceeded`: phase runtime exceeds baseline for plan size/profile.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:189:- `gate_permanent_iterate`: review/gate sends work back repeatedly without new evidence.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:193:- `plan_loop_degenerate`: plan keeps producing equivalent subplans with no execution progress.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:194:- `finalize_output_empty`: chain reaches finalize but deliverable artifacts are missing.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:198:- `human_action_blocking`: open user action blocks progress and should be surfaced as a human gate, not a repair problem.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/data/auditor_signal_swarm_synthesis_20260704.md:201:- `pr_merged_chain_not_advanced`: PR merged but chain still waits on review/merge.
