arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:5:The `megaplan` pipeline (packaged at `megaplan/pipelines/planning/`) is the built-in megaplan plan-production substrate.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:6:Its canonical registry identity is `megaplan` with the legacy alias `planning → megaplan`.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:7:It orchestrates the full prepare → plan → critique/gate/revise loop →
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:8:finalize → execute → review lifecycle.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:14:The gate stage emits a `PipelineVerdict` whose `recommendation` field is one
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:19:| `proceed` | Gate approved the plan; advance to finalize (and optionally execute). |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:20:| `iterate` | Gate rejected the plan; re-enter the critique → revise loop. |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:28:Robustness controls the depth of the critique/gate loop and the number of
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:33:| `bare` | `tiny` | Single-pass, no gate loop. Fastest; for quick drafts. |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:34:| `light` | — | One critique + revise round, minimal gate criteria. |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:35:| `full` | `standard` | Standard gate loop (default). Balanced quality/cost. |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:36:| `thorough` | `robust` | Extended gate loop, stricter criteria, more evaluators. |
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:46:prep → plan → critique ──→ gate ──proceed──→ finalize [→ execute → review]
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:50:                               └──tiebreaker──→ [adjudication] → finalize
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:53:Driver substrate: `subprocess_isolated` (execute/review) + `graph+loop-node`
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/pipelines/planning/SKILL.md:54:(critique→gate→revise subloop).
