codex
The gate handler is the natural pre-execution enforcement point: it already computes structured signals, normalizes model output, reprompts for unresolved blocking flags, and routes to proceed/iterate/escalate/tiebreaker. I’m checking finalization and review next to decide what belongs pre-execution versus closeout.
