codex
The auto-driver is intentionally dumb, so the feature must emit ordinary Megaplan outcomes (`ITERATE`, `ESCALATE`, review `needs_rework`, policy denial) rather than expecting the driver to understand North Star semantics. That keeps the automation boundary clean.
